"Vienmēr varat {{ .s1 }}lūgt tīmekļa pārzinim{{ .s2 }} palīdzēt meklēšanā vai"
" ziņot par problēmu, ja uzskatāt, ka tas vajadzīgs."

#: layouts/404.html:13
msgid ""
"If you typed the page address in the Address bar, make sure that it is "
"spelled correctly."
msgstr ""
"Ja lapas adresi ievadījāt adreses joslā, pārliecinieties, ka tā uzrakstīta "
"pareizi."

#: layouts/404.html:6
msgid ""
"If you clicked on a link that brought you to this page, or you have reached "
"this page through a search engine or bookmark, it could very well be that "
"the page you were looking for was removed, renamed or temporarily "
"unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Ja uz šo lapu nonācāt, noklikšķinot uz saites, vai no meklētājprogrammas vai"
" grāmatzīmes, ļoti iespējams, ka meklētā lapa ir noņemta, pārdēvēta vai "
"īslaicīgi nav pieejama."

#: layouts/404.html:15
msgid "Click the Back button to try another link."
msgstr "Noklikšķiniet uz pogas „Atpakaļ”, lai mēģinātu citu saiti."

#: layouts/404.html:14
msgid ""
"Open the {{ .s1 }}Xfce home page{{ .s2 }} and look for links to the "
"information you want."
msgstr ""
"Atveriet {{ .s1 }}Xfce sākumlapu{{ .s2 }} un meklējiet saites uz vajadzīgo "
"informāciju."

#: layouts/404.html:4
msgid ""
"We're sorry, the page or file you requested was not found on this server."
msgstr "Diemžēl pieprasītā lapa vai fails šajā serverī netika atrasts."

#: layouts/404.html:9
msgid ""
"Please try one of the following methods to find the page you are looking "
"for:"
msgstr "Lūdzu, mēģiniet atrast meklēto lapu kādā no šiem veidiem:"

