#: layouts/projects/list.html:62
msgid ""
"Allows you to search, launch and find information about applications "
"installed on your system."
msgstr ""
"Ļauj meklēt, palaist un atrast informāciju par sistēmā instalētajām "
"lietotnēm."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:93
msgid "Applications"
msgstr "Lietotnes"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:7
msgid "Core Components"
msgstr "Pamatkomponenti"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:161
msgid "online documentation for the core modules of Xfce"
msgstr "Xfce pamatmoduļu tiešsaistes dokumentācija"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:76
msgid "Xfce Libraries"
msgstr "Xfce bibliotēkas"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:78
msgid "Widgets library for the Xfce desktop environment."
msgstr "Logdaļu bibliotēka Xfce darbvirsmas videi."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:138
msgid "Text Editor"
msgstr "Teksta redaktors"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:140
msgid "A simple text editor."
msgstr "Vienkāršs teksta redaktors."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:146
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Paziņojumi"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:148
msgid "Easily themable notification daemon with transparency effects."
msgstr "Viegli maināma motīva paziņojumu dēmons ar caurspīdīguma efektiem."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:20
msgid "Panel"
msgstr "Panelis"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:22
msgid ""
"The panel is a bar which allows you to have at all times program launchers, "
"panel menus, a clock, a desktop switcher and more."
msgstr ""
"Panelis ir josla, kurā vienmēr var atrasties programmu palaidēji, paneļa "
"izvēlnes, pulkstenis, darbvirsmu pārslēdzējs un vēl daudz kas cits."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:68
msgid "Power Manager"
msgstr "Barošanas pārvaldnieks"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:70
msgid "Manages the power sources of the computer and connected devices."
msgstr "Pārvalda datora un pievienoto ierīču barošanas avotus."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:114
msgid "Image Viewer"
msgstr "Attēlu skatītājs"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:116
msgid "Ristretto is a lightweight image viewer."
msgstr "Ristretto ir viegls attēlu skatītājs."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:122
msgid "Screen Saver"
msgstr "Ekrānsaudzētājs"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:124
msgid "A simple screen saver and locker."
msgstr "Vienkāršs ekrānsaudzētājs un bloķētājs."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:130
msgid "Screen Shooter"
msgstr "Ekrānuzņēmumu rīks"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:132
msgid "An application to take screenshots."
msgstr "Lietotne ekrānuzņēmumu uzņemšanai."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:36
msgid "Session Manager"
msgstr "Sesiju pārvaldnieks"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:38
msgid ""
"The session manager controls all aspects of the startup and the shutdown of "
"the user session."
msgstr ""
"Sesiju pārvaldnieks vada visus lietotāja sesijas startēšanas un izslēgšanas "
"aspektus."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:44
msgid "Settings Manager"
msgstr "Iestatījumu pārvaldnieks"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:46
msgid "It allows you to configure every detail of your desktop environment."
msgstr "Ļauj konfigurēt katru darbvirsmas vides detaļu."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:98
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "Terminālis"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:100
msgid ""
"Terminal is a modern terminal emulator featuring tabs and transparent "
"backgrounds."
msgstr ""
"Terminālis ir moderns termināļa emulators ar cilnēm un caurspīdīgu fonu."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:52
msgid "Thunar File Manager"
msgstr "Thunar failu pārvaldnieks"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:54
msgid ""
"Thunar is a modern file manager designed from the ground up to be fast and "
"easy-to-use."
msgstr ""
"Thunar ir moderns failu pārvaldnieks, kas jau no paša sākuma veidots, lai "
"būtu ātrs un viegli lietojams."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:106
msgid "Xfburn"
msgstr "Xfburn"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:108
msgid "Xfburn is an application to create and burn CD's and DVD's."
msgstr "Xfburn ir lietotne CD un DVD disku izveidei un ierakstīšanai."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:84
msgid "Xfconf"
msgstr "Xfconf"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:86
msgid "Simple client-server configuration storage and query system."
msgstr ""
"Vienkārša klienta-servera konfigurācijas glabāšanas un vaicājumu sistēma."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:28
msgid "Desktop Manager"
msgstr "Darbvirsmas pārvaldnieks"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:30
msgid ""
"This program sets the background image and provides a root window menu, "
"desktop icons or minimized icons and a windows list."
msgstr ""
"Šī programma iestata fona attēlu un nodrošina saknes loga izvēlni, "
"darbvirsmas ikonas vai minimizēto logu ikonas un logu sarakstu."

#: layouts/projects/list.html:12
msgid "Window Manager"
msgstr "Logu pārvaldnieks"

#: layouts/projects/list.html:14
msgid ""
"It manages the placement of application windows on the screen, provides "
"window decorations and manages workspaces or virtual desktops."
msgstr ""
"Tā pārvalda lietotņu logu izvietojumu ekrānā, nodrošina logu noformējumu un "
"pārvalda darba vietas jeb virtuālās darbvirsmas."

